Gegroet,


Well, it may surprise you a little bit, but I do actually agree with 
you. If you read the "introduction", I actually mention this list as 
being "tempory" and moving it to sourceforge is my main goal.


But, I do not have any experience on setting up sourceforge-webpages 
(while do I already have two lists on yahoo) and -when the traffic 
starts going on the list and the people of the different projects do 
start to talk- a move to a more suited system will probably happen.


My main goal now is to bring everybody together. After that, we can work 
from there on.


I actually had my first 6 members in as less as 12 minutes; so it starts 
OK. There do seams to be quite some people interested in this program. 
(it does is a very good piece of work, if you ask me; all my respects to 
mr. Manninen.



Cheerio!
kristoff ON1ARF

